# NOTE: this file is read from the repository root for every Vercel project in
# this repo — including the backend project whose Root Directory is `backend`.
# So it must NOT blanket-ignore `backend/` (that empties the backend deploy).
# Instead, exclude only the backend's local artefacts and secrets; the frontend
# project uploads the backend source (~90 small files, unused by `next build`).
.github/
backend/.venv/
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
backend/.pytest_cache/
backend/**/__pycache__/
backend/**/*.pyc
backend/staticfiles/
backend/*.log
